cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use the data or the methods, please cite the paper below and the version of the data
  package you used.
type: software
title: "matcon-data-and-methods: Data and methods for The analysis of material contracts"
abstract: >-
  The website, and the sample its examples run on, for an open database of the material contracts
  (Exhibit 10 attachments) filed with the SEC between 1999 and 2024: what the database holds, how
  to get each part of it, and the methods behind it, classification and entity extraction, each
  with a worked example.
